    <p>Research topic open, updated 23 November 2026 against <code>openIE-dev/rce</code> commit <code>f87d6af2</code> (23 November 2026; <code>5,393</code> Lean 4.36.0 theorem constants from <code>1,264</code> source declarations across <code>64</code> modules, theorems T1 to T63, verified across all six independent proof checkers of <code>lake check --paranoid</code>, <code>2,221/2,236</code> conformance tests passing with <code>0</code> failures, <code>837</code> Rust checker unit tests; empirical benchmarks registered against <code>1762fb4b</code>; interactive observatory at <a href="/living/rce-jepa/">/living/rce-jepa/</a>). Phase 0 deterministic floors are measured: H1 is supported on the hand-written population at a median rho of <code>9.34</code> over 185 programs (W1 version 1 gave <code>9.31</code> over 173); H8 is supported across <code>10,500</code> seeded event streams on six targets with <code>0</code> mismatches (<code>rce/bench/determinism/</code>); H7's fuzzed arm found <code>0</code> invariant violations across <code>1,275</code> checker-accepted mutants (<code>rce/bench/adversarial/</code>); and H14 is supported across three registered runs of <code>rce repair</code> [B30, B31, B32], closing <code>111</code> of <code>151</code> tasks (<code>73.5%</code>) at zero model calls in the plain arm of run 3 and leaving <code>40</code> open git-history residual tasks. On 22–23 November 2026 [B33, B34, B35, B36], Apple M5 Max and AMD Ryzen AI Max+ 395 / Radeon 8060S <code>reported_j</code> receipts (<code>measured_j = None</code>, <code>board_metered = false</code>) established <strong>H2 supported</strong> (<code>C_check / E_model = 0.04904 J / 84.25 J = 0.000582 &lt;= 0.05</code>, <code>1,718×</code> cheaper; full 62-Form check+run+emit suite <code>15.44 J</code>), trained and evaluated <strong><code>FormJEPA-v1</code></strong> (<code>8.42M</code> parameters: <code>177/200</code> unseen synthetic defects, <code>22/40</code> at <code>k = 1</code> and <code>