de> fewer Gear-2 episodes), and audited 151-task <strong><code>rce repair</code> rung <code>f</code></strong> promotion (<code>3/119 = 2.5% &gt; 2.0%</code>, <code>3/3</code> passing <code>W-MUT-1</code>, <code>0</code> contradictions, confirming rung <code>f</code> remains in <code>observe</code> mode). Still open: full intent-to-Form synthesis (H3), end-to-end joule parity (H4), cross-module signature-and-trace OOD energy calibration beyond <code>0.5278</code> across multi-module git-history rewrites, reference-app encoding (H6), cost-table prediction (H9), quotient sample-efficiency (H10), gate-receipt decision-head calibration (H12), discrete-versus-continuous long-horizon planning (H13), diffusion/evolutionary H15 arms, and external hardware-rail power metering (<code>measured_j</code>).</p>

